        "value" : "nucleic acid library construction protocol"
      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "Total RNA was extracted using the miRNAeasy mini kit (Qiagen Sciences, Inc., Germantown, MD). TruSeq RNA Sample Prep Kit v2 (Illumina, Inc., San Diego, CA)."
      } ]
    }, {
